{"id": "ST_Armor|TelvaughtSageCuirassDesc", "source_en": "The Sages of Clan Telvaught have had centuries to perfect their craft, weaving magic into their armor increasing their resilience and amplifying their power", "category": "item", "speaker": null, "ar": "امتلك حكماء عشيرة تلڤوت قرونًا من الزمن لإتقان حرفتهم، حيث نسجوا السحر في دروعهم لزيادة قدرة تحملهم وتضخيم قوتهم", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
