{"id": "ST_Armor|TelvaughtExcoriatorCuirassDesc", "source_en": "Worn by the Excoriator's of the Telvaught Clan, this armor is unknown to the world as those beyond the clan who have seen it no longer remain", "category": "item", "speaker": null, "ar": "يرتديها \"مُعذبو\" عشيرة تلڤوت، وهذه الدرع مجهولة للعالم لأن من رآها خارج العشيرة لم يعد موجوداً ليتحدث عنها.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
