{"id": "ST_Consumables|HeavyWeightDesc", "source_en": "A bludgeoning cannonball thrown to concuss a foe.  Sometimes the simplest tools are the sharpest.", "category": "item", "speaker": null, "ar": "قذيفة مدفع ثقيلة تُقذف لضرب العدو. أحياناً تكون أبسط الأدوات هي الأكثر فتكاً.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "ST_Consumables|BloodseekerBladeDesc", "source_en": "A heavy spur-bladed knife. Inflicts Bleed, and will drop to the ground if its target is killed within three seconds.", "category": "item", "speaker": null, "ar": "سكين ثقيل بنصل يشبه الـمِربط. يسبب نزيفاً، ويسقط على الأرض إذا قُتل هدفه في غضون ثلاث ثوانٍ.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "ST_Consumables|PoisonedThrowingKnifeDesc", "source_en": "A poisoned knife used by assassins. A skillful hunter knows their greatest weapon is patience.", "category": "item", "speaker": null, "ar": "سكين مسموم يستخدمه القتلة. يعرف الصياد الماهر أن أعظم أسلحته هي الصبر.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
